@startuml CompanyLogin
actor Company

Company -> App : Tap "Log In" on welcome screen (web dashboard or mobile app)
App -> Company : Show login form (e-mail + password)
Company -> App : Submit credentials

App -> AuthService : Authenticate (e-mail, password)
AuthService -> AuthService : Compare BCrypt hash (NFR.1)

alt Credentials valid
    AuthService -> App : Issue JWT (lifetime <=1h, NFR.2)
    App -> Company : Navigate to company home dashboard
else Credentials invalid
    AuthService -> App : Error
    App -> Company : Show "e-mail or password is incorrect"
end

alt Forgot password
    Company -> App : Tap "Forgot Password"
    App -> AuthService : Request reset
    AuthService -> Company : Send reset link (e-mail)
end

note right of App
    Google OAuth (FR.4) is not offered
    on the company login path.
end note

@enduml
